WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.841
Farmer came to the barn.

2
00:00:23.842 --> 00:00:28.668
His phone rang.

3
00:00:28.669 --> 00:00:33.392
"Hello?" said Farmer.

4
00:00:33.393 --> 00:00:37.940
"Yes. The watchdog is coming today."

5
00:00:37.941 --> 00:00:43.159
Farmer talked and talked.

6
00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:59.436
Cow moved closer to hear.

7
00:00:59.437 --> 00:01:08.359
Then Farmer left the barn.

8
00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:11.860
"Moo!" cried Cow.

9
00:01:11.861 --> 00:01:16.996
"Moo! Moo! Moo!"

10
00:01:16.997 --> 00:01:20.601
Pig ran from his pen.

11
00:01:20.602 --> 00:01:31.058
Cat and Bat came too.

12
00:01:31.059 --> 00:01:34.545
"I have news!" said Cow.

13
00:01:34.546 --> 00:01:37.978
"What is it?" asked Pig.

14
00:01:37.979 --> 00:01:42.101
"It is BIG news!" said Cow.

15
00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:46.092
"A dog is coming to the farm!"

16
00:01:46.093 --> 00:01:49.392
"A DOG?" cried Cat.

17
00:01:49.393 --> 00:01:53.931
"Yes," said Cow. "A dog."

18
00:01:53.932 --> 00:01:59.545
"But dogs bark," said Cat.

19
00:01:59.546 --> 00:02:04.390
"And they chase cats!

20
00:02:04.391 --> 00:02:08.823
Dogs do not like cats!" said Cat.

21
00:02:08.824 --> 00:02:13.837
"And cats do not like dogs!"

